{"id":"HAD-0519","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"Abū Hurayrah رضي الله عنه berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"Barmherzigkeit wird nur einem Unglückseligen **entzogen**.","source":"Sunan Abī Dāwūd / at-Tirmiḏī","grade":"ḥasan","verificationNote":"Ḥadīṯ-Unterblock im 100er-Schritt 451–550."}